# Afro Pop-Open Level-All Welcome

Afro pop classes are fun and full of movement and upbeat choreography. All fitness levels are welcome. Classes are to recorded music and are West African dance inspired classes.

 NO CURRENT CLASSES RUNNING

_Terms and Conditions:  All dance classes sunshine coast are non-refundable, non-transferable, and expire after 4 weeks._

![Dance Classes to live drumming on the Sunshine Coast.Get Fit - Have Fun](/media/2019/03/IMG_5761.jpg) 

# Dundun Dance Level-All Welcome

Dundun Dance is fun and focuses on coordination, movement and drumming. No previous experience required and drums are provided. Get powerful, loud and fit with these rhythmic dance classes.

No current dundun dance classes running.

_Terms and Conditions:  All dance classes are non-refundable, non-transferable, and expire after 4 weeks._

